{"unit_id":"ICCuse__dsh-pain-point-check#card-zh","repo":"ICCuse/dsh-pain-point-check","commit":"1dfa372a1d9ed5b58f9f1683c150fbcf101bb268","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pain-point-check 是面向 DeepSeek Harness agent loop 的卡点复盘门禁插件。它监听工具结果、步骤和会话事件，在失败调用或连续相同调用达到阈值后注入三问，并在待检查期间拦截非调查类工具，允许配置调查工具白名单。主要功能包括统计失败与重复调用、提示确认当前卡点、要求说明负结果排除了什么、要求比较方案性价比，以及在用户提出新问题或回答完整后重置门禁。适合希望 agent 在反复尝试时停下来检查假设的 DSH 使用者。阈值和白名单可配置，默认阈值为二；不需要外部服务或 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:148-229","src/index.ts:38-54"]}
{"unit_id":"ICCuse__dsh-pain-point-check#card-en","repo":"ICCuse/dsh-pain-point-check","commit":"1dfa372a1d9ed5b58f9f1683c150fbcf101bb268","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-pain-point-check adds a review gate to the DeepSeek Harness agent loop. After repeated or failed tool calls, it asks the agent to reassess the blocker and prior results, then blocks non-investigative calls until answers are given. Users can configure thresholds and investigation tools.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:148-229","src/index.ts:38-54"]}
